Vulkan backdrop blur control for the local Sway 1.12 HDR build.
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
Local adaptation prepared for notdevblue, 2026-11-07.
Requires wlroots-0.20.2-background-blur.patch; apply after the HDR patches.

One flag follows the application's main surface. Subsurfaces, popups and
per-window capture trees are not given independent backdrop effects. Saved
transaction buffers copy the blur/scRGB flags, and runtime toggles also update
the saved main buffer while a resize transaction is pending.

