 ## Runtime only commands
 The following commands cannot be used directly in the configuration file.
 They are expected to be used with *bindsym* or at runtime through *swaymsg*(1).
+
+*background_blur* enable|disable
+	Enable or disable Vulkan backdrop blur behind the main surface of the
+	focused application. For example, *for_window [app_id="^kitty$"]
+	background_blur enable* enables it for new Kitty windows. Text and other
+	application content remain sharp. Disabled by default. Other renderers
+	ignore the effect. This command does not affect popups or subsurfaces.
 
